==English==

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|en-us-sadness.ogg|Audio (US)}}


===Noun===
'''sadness''' (''[[countable]] and [[uncountable]]; plural'' '''sadnesses''')

# {{uncountable}} The state or emotion of being sad.
# {{countable}} An event in one's life that causes sadness.
#: ''She has experienced many sadnesses in her forty years.''

====Synonyms====
*(''state of being sad''): [[forlornness]], [[melancholy]]
*(''event causing sadness''): [[misfortune]]

